---
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro"
---

<Layout
    title="Research | Oshan Mudannayake"
    description="Ongoing and completed research projects across RL, time-series, privacy-preserving ML, and computer vision."
>
    <div class="researchLayout section-wrapper">
        <div class="section-title">
            <h1>Research</h1>
        </div>
        <div class="section-items">
            <div>
                <h2>Ongoing</h2>
                <ul>
                    <li>
                        <h3>Deepfake Detection in South Asia</h3>
                        <span class="tools-text">Deepfake Detection | Machine Learning | South Asia</span><br />
                        <span class="content-text">
                            Working with Dr. Dilrukshi Gamage on deepfake detection for the South Asian region.
                        </span><br />
                        <span class="date-text">2026 - Present</span><br />
                        <span>
                            <a
                                class="link"
                                href="https://sites.google.com/view/south-asia-deepfake-detection/"
                                target="_blank"
                                rel="noopener noreferrer">[Project]</a
                            >
                        </span>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <h3>Reinforcement Learning Hyperparameter Rigor — Paired-Offset Reevaluation</h3>
                        <span class="tools-text">RL | HPO | Selection Bias | Diagnostics</span><br />
                        <span class="content-text">
                            Investigating selection-induced optimism in RL hyperparameter search and proposing a
                            paired-offset reevaluation diagnostic. Two manuscripts under review.
                        </span><br />
                        <span class="date-text">2025 - Present</span>
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            <div>
                <h2>Completed</h2>
                <ul>
                    <li>
                        <h3>
                            On Privacy-Preserved Machine Learning Using Secure Multi-Party Computing: Techniques and
                            Trends
                        </h3>
                        <span class="tools-text">ML | SMPC | Privacy</span><br />
                        <span class="content-text">
                            Comprehensive survey on privacy-preserving machine learning that employs secure multi-party
                            computing.
                        </span><br />
                        <span class="date-text">Apr. 2022 - 2025</span><br />
                        <span>
                            <a
                                class="link"
                                href="https://doi.org/10.32604/cmc.2025.068875"
                                target="_blank"
                                rel="noopener noreferrer">[Paper]</a
                            >
                        </span>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <h3>Detecting Water In Visual Image Streams Captured From Unmanned Aerial Vehicles</h3>
                        <span class="tools-text">CV | UNet | TensorFlow | OpenCV | Python</span><br />
                        <span class="content-text">
                            Our work attempts at detecting water surfaces using Unmanned Aerial Vehicles (UAV) footage.
                        </span><br />
                        <span class="date-text">Oct. 2022 - 2023</span><br />
                        <span>
                            <a
                                class="link"
                                href="https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S1047320323001839?dgcid=author"
                                target="_blank"
                                rel="noopener noreferrer">[Paper]</a
                            >
                        </span>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <h3>
                            Modeling and Prediction of Municipal Solid Waste Generation in Sri Lanka using Machine
                            Learning Techniques
                        </h3>
                        <span class="tools-text">ML | Time series | Darts | Python</span><br />
                        <span class="content-text">
                            We aimed to model and forecast solid waste generation patterns in cities using machine
                            learning techniques.
                        </span><br />
                        <span class="date-text">May 2021 - Jul. 2022</span><br />
                        <span>
                            <a
                                class="link"
                                href="https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/stamp/stamp.jsp?tp=&arnumber=9950270"
                                target="_blank"
                                rel="noopener noreferrer">[Paper]</a
                            >
                        </span>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <h3>Machine Learning based Internet Domain Entity Matching and its Applications</h3>
                        <span class="tools-text">ML | Scikit-learn | TensorFlow | Python</span><br />
                        <span class="content-text">
                            An exploratory effort to detect malicious domain URLs using machine learning techniques; the
                            project was discontinued.
                        </span><br />
                        <span class="date-text">Aug. 2020 - Dec. 2021</span>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <h3>Realtime Property Evaluation of Large Streaming Graphs</h3>
                        <span class="tools-text">Graphs | Graph Summarization | Python</span><br />
                        <span class="content-text">
                            We investigated massive graph stream summarization techniques and proposed an improved graph
                            sketch; kMatrix.
                        </span><br />
                        <span class="date-text">Jan. 2019 - Jan. 2020</span><br />
                        <span>
                            <a
                                class="link"
                                href="https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1HQr98OLbt1QBcVf28NeYp1ws2XV7admlYiCcRN5dnHA/edit?usp=sharing"
                                target="_blank"
