                                rel="noopener noreferrer">[Source]</a
                            >{" "}
                            <a
                                class="link"
                                href="/papers/mudannayake2021kmatrix.pdf"
                                target="_blank"
                                rel="noopener noreferrer">[Paper]</a
                            >
                        </span>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <h3>Machine Learning over Encrypted Data</h3>
                        <span class="tools-text">
                            ML | Encryption | SMPC | TensorFlow | Python | Google Cloud Platform
                        </span><br />
                        <span class="content-text">
                            We added a layer over TensorFlow to facilitate machine learning on encrypted data over a
                            distributed network of machines.
                        </span><br />
                        <span class="date-text">Jul. 2018 - Jan. 2019</span><br />
                        <span>
                            <a
                                class="link"
                                href="/posters/mloed_slasscom_poster.png"
                                target="_blank"
                                rel="noopener noreferrer">[Poster]</a
                            >
                        </span>
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
